    {
      "id": "sec_s2l13_r7",
      "type": "rule_paragraph",
      "data": {
        "text": "Agar kisi lafz ke shuru mein (الْـ) ho, toh usse pehle (يَا أَيُّهَا) ya (أَيَّتُهَا) lagaya jata hai, jaise teesri misaal mein wazeh hai. (يَا) aur (أَيُّهَا) dono ka ma'ana ek hi hai. Ab aap darj zail Qur'ani tarakeeb jin mein (يَا أَيُّهَا) ya (أَيُّهَا) aaya hai, khud samajh kar tarjuma kar sakte hain:",
        "content": "Agar kisi lafz ke shuru mein (الْـ) ho, toh usse pehle (يَا أَيُّهَا) ya (أَيَّتُهَا) lagaya jata hai, jaise teesri misaal mein wazeh hai. (يَا) aur (أَيُّهَا) dono ka ma'ana ek hi hai. Ab aap darj zail Qur'ani tarakeeb jin mein (يَا أَيُّهَا) ya (أَيُّهَا) aaya hai, khud samajh kar tarjuma kar sakte hain:",
        "hinglish_text": "Agar kisi lafz ke shuru mein (الْـ) ho, toh usse pehle (يَا أَيُّهَا) ya (أَيَّتُهَا) lagaya jata hai, jaise teesri misaal mein wazeh hai. (يَا) aur (أَيُّهَا) dono ka ma'ana ek hi hai. Ab aap darj zail Qur'ani tarakeeb jin mein (يَا أَيُّهَا) ya (أَيُّهَا) aaya hai, khud samajh kar tarjuma kar sakte hain:"
